msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Taiga!」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up. Even a mongrel can read＿between the lines. Don't follow me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate. Hasta un perro sabe leer＿entre líneas. No me sigas.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not upset, just frustrated!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No estoy molesta, solo frustrada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「About?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「There were heaps of things I've＿wanted to calmly say to her face since＿I last saw her......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Había montones de cosas que quería＿decirle con calma a la cara desde＿la última vez que la vi......」"

msgid "Taiga「When I saw her despicable straight＿face, my pride got in the way...... So it＿was no different from last time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Al ver su cara tan despreciable, mi＿orgullo se interpuso...... Así que＿fue igual que la última vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What happened between them......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué habrá pasado entre ellas......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Plus, there's that uneasiness I felt＿meeting Kanou Sumire for the first＿time......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Además, está esa inquietud que＿sentí al conocer a Kanou Sumire＿por primera vez......）」"

msgid "Taiga「So? You called after me, so you must＿want something.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y? Me llamaste, así que＿algo debes querer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah. You forgot......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, cierto. Olvidaste......」"

msgid "???「Aaah, what's that? SUPER filthy～①」"
msgstr "???「Aaah, ¿qué es eso? SÚPER sucio～①」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha! You guys having another＿squabble in public? Still best of＿friends, I see.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ja, ja, ja! ¿Otra vez peleando＿en público? Veo que siguen siendo＿los mejores amigos.」"

msgid "Taiga「N-No we aren't!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡N-No lo somos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What part of this looks like \"best＿friends\" to you, Kitamura? And we're＿not squabbling.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué parte de esto te parece＿de \"mejores amigos\", Kitamura?＿Y no estamos peleando.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Really? Then what's with that＿conspicuous red stain?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿En serio? ¿Entonces qué es esa＿mancha roja tan llamativa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Red stain...... Oh, that's right!! The＿blood's dried!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mancha roja......? ¡¡Ah, es cierto!!＿¡La sangre ya se secó!」"

msgid "Ami「Hold it, Tiger! Don't come near me.＿What's that orange color? You reek of＿citrus!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Espera, Tigre! No te me acerques.＿¿Qué es ese color naranja? ¡Apestas＿a cítricos!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's better than your alien body stink,＿at least. OHHHH, WHAT NOW!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mejor que tu peste a alienígena,＿al menos. ¡¡OHHHH, TOMA ESA!!」"

msgid "Ami「Aaaaaah! What do you think you're＿doing, you little shit!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Aaaaaah! ¡¿Qué demonios crees＿que haces, maldita mocosa?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha! Everyone's in high spirits＿this year as well～」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ja, ja, ja! Todos están llenos＿de energía este año también～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What are the two of you up to?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué andan haciendo ustedes dos?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, Ami came to give New Year's＿greetings to my parents. Now I'm＿walking her home.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, Ami vino a saludar a mis＿padres por Año Nuevo. Ahora＿la acompaño a su casa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Still playing goody-goody, huh. Must be＿nice to have so much free time.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sigues haciéndote la buena, eh. Qué＿suerte tener tanto tiempo libre.」"

msgid "Ami「Unlike YOU, I have common sense! Of＿course I had to play nice in front of＿Yuusaku's folks.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡A diferencia de TI, tengo sentido＿común! Claro que tenía que portarme＿bien con los padres de Yuusaku.」"

msgid "Taiga「Aren't entertainers normally busy on＿New Year's? Oh yeah, StuChi is an＿exception. Oops.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Los artistas no suelen estar ocupados＿en Año Nuevo? Ah, claro, StuChi＿es una excepción. Ups.」"

msgid "Ami「Excuse me? I'm not some variety show＿host! I'm a model. M-O-D-E-L!」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Disculpa? ¡No soy presentadora＿de programas de variedades! Soy＿modelo. ¡M-O-D-E-L-O!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Haha, same as usual...... So, may I ask＿why the two of you are wandering＿around soaked in blood and juice?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Jaja, como siempre...... Y bien,＿¿puedo saber por qué andan por ahí＿empapados en sangre y jugo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I ran into Taiga at Super＿Kanou-Mart.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, me topé con Taiga＿en el Super Kanou-Mart.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Kanou-Mart?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¿Kanou-Mart?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Ryuuji!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Sumire-san...... Prez? You encountered＿her?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sumire-san...... ¿la Presidenta?＿¿Se encontraron con ella?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「S-Sí.」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「I see, so Prez is back......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya veo, la Presidenta volvió......」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun, umm--」"
msgstr "Taiga「Kitamura-kun, ehm--」"

msgid "Kitamura「......NOOOT!! Did you think I was upset,＿Aisaka?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡MENTIRAAA! ¿Pensaste que＿estaba afectado, Aisaka?」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Kitamura-kun......」"

msgid "Kitamura「What's that look for? Worried about＿me? No need for that. I'll show you that＿I'm just fine!!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Y esa cara? ¿Preocupada por mí?＿No hace falta. ¡¡Les demostraré＿que estoy de maravilla!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, don't start stripping!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera, no te empieces a desvestir!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿K-Kitamura?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ah ha ha ha ha...... AAH HA HA HA＿HA......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, ja, ja, ja, ja...... ¡AAH,＿JA, JA, JA, JA......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wasn't he walking Kawashima＿home......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No estaba acompañando a Kawashima＿a su casa......?」"

msgid "Taiga「STUPID! Stupid Ryuuji! Why would you＿go and tell Kitamura-kun about that＿woman!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡ESTÚPIDO! ¡Estúpido Ryuuji!＿¡¿Para qué le cuentas a Kitamura-kun＿sobre esa mujer?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Gasp* That reminds me! The younger＿sister was told to keep her mouth shut＿about it......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah! ¡Ahora recuerdo! ¡A la hermana＿menor le dijeron que mantuviera la＿boca cerrada sobre eso......!」"

msgid "Taiga「Then you've been promoted to moron,＿idiot!! Stupid trash, stupid trash trash＿TRASH TRASH TRASH!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Entonces ascendiste a imbécil,＿idiota!! ¡¡Basura tonta, basura＿tonta BASURA BASURA BASURA!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Owwww, THAT HURTS! Hold on a＿second! Kitamura is more important＿here!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Auuu, ESO DUELE! ¡Espera un segundo!＿¡Kitamura es más importante ahora!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's going on with him? Obviously＿something was wrong with him, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué le pasa? Es obvio que algo＿anda mal con él, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ami「......Yuusaku was rejected by that＿former student council president.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Esa expresidenta del consejo＿estudiantil rechazó a Yuusaku.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What did you say!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué dijiste?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wait, StuChi!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Espera, StuChi!!」"

msgid "Ami「We shouldn't hide it, right? It's the＿truth, after all.」"
msgstr "Ami「No deberíamos ocultarlo, ¿no? Es＿la verdad, después de todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「But it's not your place to tell people＿about it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Pero no te corresponde andar＿contándoselo a la gente!」"

msgid "Ami「Same goes for everyone. But it was a＿flat-out rejection in front of all of us.＿Someone's bound to talk about it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Lo mismo aplica a todos. Pero fue un＿rechazo rotundo frente a nosotros.＿Alguien iba a hablar de eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「......She's the worst!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Es lo peor!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「H-Hey!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡O-Oigan!」"

msgid "Ami「Have you considered leaving her＿alone? If she really wanted it kept＿quiet, she'd shut me up by force.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Pensaste en dejarla en paz? Si de＿verdad quisiera mantenerlo en secreto,＿me callaría a la fuerza.」"

msgid "Ami「Maybe she's tricking me into saying＿what she can't? How awful ① Well,＿Ami-chan's nice enough to tell you.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Me engaña para que diga lo que ella＿no puede? Qué mala ① Ami-chan es＿tan amable que te lo dirá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it true that Kitamura was rejected?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Es verdad que rechazaron a Kitamura?」"

msgid "Ami「Yup. At the student council election,＿he confessed in front of the whole＿school and was honorably shot down.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sip. En la elección del consejo＿estudiantil, se declaró ante toda la＿escuela y fue rechazado con honor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Th-That's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Eso es......」"

msgid "Ami「Yup, SUPER crushing. And then there＿was that piece of shit, Tiger.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sip, SÚPER demoledor. Y luego＿estaba esa basura de Tigre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What about Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué hay con Taiga?」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What did Taiga do?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué hizo Taiga?」"

msgid "Ami「Ahaha ① You're funnyyy.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ajaja ① Qué graciosooo eres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Isn't it obvious that I don't? Please tell＿me about this \"turn of events\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No es obvio que no? Por favor, háblame＿de ese \"giro de los hechos\".」"

msgid "Ami「No. Way. ① Say, what's it feel like to＿have amnesia?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ni. Hablar. ① Oye, ¿qué se＿siente tener amnesia?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「With that attitude of yours, and this＿brain of mine, it's PISSING ME OFF!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Con esa actitud tuya y este cerebro＿mío, todo ME ESTÁ SACANDO DE QUICIO!」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm...... In a way, not knowing is＿practically a crime.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmmm...... En cierto modo, no saber＿es prácticamente un crimen.」"

msgid "Ami「......I see, so this is what it means to not＿remember anything.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Ya veo, así que esto es lo＿que significa no recordar nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not \"Ufu①\"! If you're not going to＿talk, I'm leaving.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No, nada de \"Juju①\"! Si no＿vas a hablar, me voy.」"

msgid "Ami「Okay, bye-byeee.」"
msgstr "Ami「Está bien, adiooos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That was quick.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué rápido.」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Honestly, what is she thinking......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（En serio, ¿qué estará pensando......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait up, Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera, Taiga!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Did StuChi tell you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿StuChi te lo contó?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「About Kitamura? ......I'm not entirely＿sure if she did or not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sobre Kitamura? ......No estoy del＿todo seguro de si lo hizo o no.」"

msgid "Taiga「What does THAT mean?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué significa ESO?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She said nothing more than that＿Kitamura was rejected by the former＿student council president.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo dijo que Kitamura fue rechazado＿por la expresidenta del consejo＿estudiantil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's hard to answer...... It depends on＿how much I liked them, and what they＿thought of me, and stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es difícil responder...... Depende＿de cuánto me gustara, de lo que pensara＿de mí, y esas cosas.」"

msgid "Taiga「Look at you, talking about it like it's＿not your problem.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mírate, hablando del tema como＿si no fuera tu problema.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I said it's hard to answer......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「D-Dije que es difícil responder......」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm the idiot for asking you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Soy una idiota por preguntarte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's your problem......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What happened...... between the three＿of them?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué habrá pasado......＿entre ellos tres?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't purposefully make me say banal＿things like \"my house is this way too.\"＿What's got you upset?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me hagas decir obviedades como \"mi＿casa también queda por aquí\". ¿Qué es＿lo que te tiene tan molesta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And you were so rude to our senpai.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y fuiste grosera con nuestra senpai.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A lot of stuff happened, and the＿younger daughter kindly offered to＿wash our clothes, but......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pasaron muchas cosas, y la hija＿menor se ofreció amablemente a lavarnos＿la ropa, pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As soon as SHE caught sight of the＿older sister Sumire-san......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En cuanto ELLA vio a Sumire-san,＿la hermana mayor......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm, I see. Even if I get naked, my＿internal organs won't be proven＿healthy. Me, of all people! Goodness!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mm, ya veo. Aunque me desnude, no se＿demostrará que mis órganos estén sanos.＿¡Justo a mí! ¡Qué cosas!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Rude, rude, rude! Ah ha ha ha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Grosero, grosero, grosero!＿¡Ja ja ja ja!」"

msgid "Kitamura「In other words, Aisaka, I don't care in＿the least! As you can see, my body and＿mind are perfectly normal!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「En otras palabras, Aisaka, ¡no me＿importa nada! Como ves, ¡mi cuerpo＿y mi mente son del todo normales!」"

msgid "Kitamura「With this, I shall take my leave. Peace＿out!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Con esto, paso a retirarme. ¡Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun, after listening to the＿story so far, you REALLY don't＿remember ANYTHING about it?」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun, tras escuchar la historia＿hasta aquí, ¿DE VERDAD no recuerdas＿NADA al respecto?」"

msgid "Ami「Even though the turn of events was so＿dramatic?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Aunque el giro de los hechos＿fue tan dramático?」"

msgid "Taiga「I see...... Hey Ryuuji, if you got rejected＿by your crush, became separated from＿them......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo...... Oye, Ryuuji, si quien te＿gusta te rechazara, se separaran......」"

msgid "Taiga「And then after sorting out your＿feelings in your own way, your crush＿comes back-- what would you do?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Y tras ordenar tus sentimientos＿a tu manera, esa persona regresa--＿¿tú qué harías?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What's with Taiga......? It's not just＿about Kitamura. Ever since we ran into＿Kanou Sumire......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué le pasa a Taiga......? No es＿solo por Kitamura. Desde que nos topamos＿con Kanou Sumire......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hasn't something obviously been＿wrong with her since then?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿No es obvio que le pasa algo＿raro desde entonces?）」"
